# Cloudflare Pages redirects — Columbus Districts
# 301s from old WordPress URLs to the Astro build, so bookmarks, inbound links, and
# Google's existing index of the old site don't 404. Canonical district URLs are
# /districts/district-<word>/  (e.g. /districts/district-one/).
#
# IMPORTANT — trailing slash matters on Cloudflare Pages: "/district-seven" and
# "/district-seven/" are matched separately, and the old WordPress URLs were indexed
# WITH a trailing slash. Every source is therefore listed in both forms so both redirect.
# Real 404s are captured via the GA4 "page_not_found" event (src/pages/404.astro);
# promote any that surface and prune guesses that never fire.

